    '[PENGENALAN PRODUK]
AP Boots ORCA merupakan sepatu boot kerja AP Orca Series berstandar resmi produksi PT Waru Gunung (Surabaya) dan didistribusikan secara global oleh PT Indo Sukses Semesta (HOTS Trading). Dibuat menggunakan teknologi direct high-pressure injection molding terpadu tanpa sambungan lem (100% seamless injection), menjamin ketahanan air mutlak, bebas bocor, dan memiliki durabilitas prima di berbagai kondisi pemakaian di Indonesia maupun pasar ekspor.

[MATERIAL & SPESIFIKASI KONSTRUKSI]
• Material Upper: High Shaft PVC (38 - 40 cm) dengan formulasi anti-retak (UV & weather resistant) yang fleksibel mengikuti kontur pergerakan kaki secara ergonomis.
• Material Outsole: Molded PVC Cleated Sole berprofil cleated lug mendalam, memberikan daya cengkeram optimal (Saltwater-Resistant Anti-Hydroplaning Tread) di atas lumpur tebal, permukaan basah berair, genangan minyak/oli, dan lantai keramik licin.
• Insole & Kenyamanan: Bantalan insole anatomis penyerap getaran (shock absorption) yang meminimalkan kelelahan kaki saat pemakaian jangka panjang sepanjang hari.
• Dimensi Fisik: Tinggi Profil/Shaft 40.0 cm | Bobot Rata-Rata: 1750 gram per pasang | Pilihan Ukuran: EU 39 - 45.

[FITUR KESELAMATAN & STANDAR KUALITAS]
• Proteksi Utama: Tahan Air Asin Laut, Tahan Minyak Ikan, Sol Anti Tergelincir di Dek Kapal Basah.
• Proteksi Kaki & Jari: None (Plain Reinforced Soft Toe).
• Ketahanan Kimiawi & Cairan: Tahan terhadap paparan oli mineral, pelumas mesin, kotoran hewan ternak, larutan asam/basa encer, serta lumpur gambut perkebunan kelapa sawit.
• Sertifikasi Resmi: Memenuhi Standar Nasional Indonesia (SNI 0111:2009), ISO 9001:2015, dan standar mutu pabrik PT Waru Gunung.

[REKOMENDASI APLIKASI]
Sangat ideal digunakan pada sektor: Perikanan Laut Dalam, Industri Cold Storage, Galangan Kapal, Pengolahan Ikan.

[PANDUAN PEMILIHAN UKURAN & PERAWATAN]
• Panduan Ukuran: EU 39 - 45. Disarankan memilih ukuran standar alas kaki harian Anda. Jika memakai kaus kaki tebal, pertimbangkan memilih 1 nomor lebih besar.
• Petunjuk Perawatan: Bersihkan permukaan dengan air mengalir setelah pemakaian. Keringkan di area berventilasi baik dan teduh. Hindari penjemuran langsung di bawah terik matahari agar polimer tetap elastis dan tahan bertahun-tahun.', '[EXECUTIVE PRODUCT OVERVIEW]
AP Boots ORCA is a industrial AP Orca Series engineered by PT Waru Gunung and distributed internationally by PT Indo Sukses Semesta (HOTS Trading). Built utilizing advanced direct high-pressure single-shot injection molding technology, this product provides 100% seamless waterproofing, zero-delamination guarantee, and reliable durability for commercial, institutional, and consumer markets worldwide.

[TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS MATRIX]
• Upper Material: High Shaft PVC (38 - 40 cm) formulated with virgin polymer elastomeric blends for high tensile strength, continuous flex endurance, and crack resistance.
• Outsole Construction: Molded PVC Cleated Sole engineered with heavy self-cleaning cleated lugs and siping channels, achieving certified slip resistance (Saltwater-Resistant Anti-Hydroplaning Tread) across oily, greasy, muddy, and wet inclined surfaces.
• Comfort Architecture: Anatomical shock-absorbing footbed with quick-drying interior support to mitigate moisture build-up and foot fatigue during prolonged wear.
• Physical Parameters: Profile/Shaft Height: 40.0 cm | Unit Weight: 1750 g/pair | Sizing Range: EU 39 - 45.

[SAFETY SPECIFICATIONS & REGULATORY COMPLIANCE]
• Impact & Compression Protection: None (Plain Reinforced Soft Toe).
• Underfoot Penetration Shield: None.
• Quality Assurance Standards: Complies with SNI 0111:2009, ISO 9001:2015, and GPSR EU 2023/988 quality criteria.
• Material & Environmental Defense: High resistance against water, mild detergents, mineral oils, and everyday surface wear.

[RECOMMENDED INDUSTRIAL VERTICALS]
Specifically tailored for: Deep-Sea Commercial Fisheries, Cold Storage Logistics, Shipyards, Marine Processing Facilities.

[EXPORT PACKAGING & LOGISTICS CAPABILITIES]
• Master Carton Packaging: Export Grade 5-Ply Corrugated Master Carton, 12 pairs per carton.
• Carton Dimensions: 58 x 42 x 38 cm | Volume: 0.0960 CBM | Gross Weight: 19.50 kg.
• Container Loadability: Approx. 3,600 pairs per 20ft FCL / Approx. 8,500 pairs per 40ft HQ FCL.
• Primary Seaport of Loading: Tanjung Perak Seaport (ID SUB), Surabaya / Tanjung Priok (ID TKG), Jakarta, Indonesia.', 'Perikanan Laut Dalam, Industri Cold Storage, Galangan Kapal, Pengolahan Ikan',
    'ap boots, ap boots orca, sepatu boot karet, sepatu boot pvc, safety boots indonesia, waterproof work boots, pvc rain boots wholesale, commercial marine & cold storage, sepatu pabrik sni', '/assets/shopee/AP_Boots_ORCA_Sepatu_Boot_PVC/hero_AP_Boots_ORCA_Sepatu_Boot_PVC.webp', 'SHOPEE',
    16
);
