    '[PENGENALAN PRODUK]
AP KIDS SAFARI ZEBRA merupakan sepatu boot hujan anak tahan air dan ringan berstandar resmi produksi PT Waru Gunung (Surabaya) dan didistribusikan secara global oleh PT Indo Sukses Semesta (HOTS Trading). Dibuat menggunakan teknologi direct high-pressure injection molding terpadu tanpa sambungan lem (100% seamless injection), menjamin ketahanan air mutlak, bebas bocor, dan memiliki durabilitas prima di berbagai kondisi pemakaian di Indonesia maupun pasar ekspor.

[MATERIAL & SPESIFIKASI KONSTRUKSI]
• Material Upper: Printed Safe PVC dengan formulasi anti-retak (UV & weather resistant) yang fleksibel mengikuti kontur pergerakan kaki secara ergonomis.
• Material Outsole: Molded PVC Cleated Sole ergonomis anti-slip (Wave Texture Non-Marking Sole) untuk daya cengkeram stabil di lantai basah, keramik, dan permukaan harian.
• Insole & Kenyamanan: Bantalan insole anatomis penyerap getaran (shock absorption) yang meminimalkan kelelahan kaki saat pemakaian jangka panjang sepanjang hari.
• Dimensi Fisik: Tinggi Profil/Shaft 20.0 cm | Bobot Rata-Rata: 520 gram per pasang | Pilihan Ukuran: EU 26 - 32.

[FITUR KESELAMATAN & STANDAR KUALITAS]
• Proteksi Utama: Motif Garis Belang Zebra Unik, Bobot Ekstra Ringan untuk Balita Lari-Larian.
• Proteksi Kaki & Jari: Soft Flexible Rounded Toe (Phthalate Free).
• Ketahanan Air & Perawatan Mudah: 100% tahan air, mudah dicuci/disterilkan, cepat kering, serta tahan terhadap paparan cairan harian dan deterjen ringan.
• Sertifikasi Resmi: Memenuhi Standar Nasional Indonesia (SNI 0111:2009), ISO 9001:2015, dan standar mutu pabrik PT Waru Gunung.

[REKOMENDASI APLIKASI]
Sangat ideal digunakan pada sektor: Anak Sekolah Musim Hujan, Aktivitas Luar Ruangan Taman, Bermain Genangan Air Bersih.

[PANDUAN PEMILIHAN UKURAN & PERAWATAN]
• Panduan Ukuran: EU 26 - 32. Disarankan memilih ukuran standar alas kaki harian Anda. Jika memakai kaus kaki tebal, pertimbangkan memilih 1 nomor lebih besar.
• Petunjuk Perawatan: Bersihkan permukaan dengan air mengalir setelah pemakaian. Keringkan di area berventilasi baik dan teduh. Hindari penjemuran langsung di bawah terik matahari agar polimer tetap elastis dan tahan bertahun-tahun.', '[EXECUTIVE PRODUCT OVERVIEW]
AP KIDS SAFARI ZEBRA is a lightweight waterproof PVC children''s rain boots engineered by PT Waru Gunung and distributed internationally by PT Indo Sukses Semesta (HOTS Trading). Built utilizing advanced direct high-pressure single-shot injection molding technology, this product provides 100% seamless waterproofing, zero-delamination guarantee, and reliable durability for commercial, institutional, and consumer markets worldwide.

[TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS MATRIX]
• Upper Material: Printed Safe PVC formulated with virgin polymer elastomeric blends for high tensile strength, continuous flex endurance, and crack resistance.
• Outsole Construction: Molded PVC Cleated Sole engineered with ergonomic anti-slip tread geometry, achieving reliable slip resistance (Wave Texture Non-Marking Sole) across wet tiles, smooth floors, and daily commercial surfaces.
• Comfort Architecture: Anatomical shock-absorbing footbed with quick-drying interior support to mitigate moisture build-up and foot fatigue during prolonged wear.
• Physical Parameters: Profile/Shaft Height: 20.0 cm | Unit Weight: 520 g/pair | Sizing Range: EU 26 - 32.

[SAFETY SPECIFICATIONS & REGULATORY COMPLIANCE]
• Impact & Compression Protection: Soft Flexible Rounded Toe (Phthalate Free).
• Underfoot Penetration Shield: None.
• Quality Assurance Standards: Complies with SNI 0111:2009, ISO 9001:2015, and GPSR EU 2023/988 quality criteria.
• Material & Environmental Defense: High resistance against water, mild detergents, mineral oils, and everyday surface wear.

[RECOMMENDED APPLICATIONS]
Specifically tailored for: School Commuters, Outdoor Parks, Children Rainy Season Play.

[EXPORT PACKAGING & LOGISTICS CAPABILITIES]
• Master Carton Packaging: Export Grade 5-Ply Corrugated Master Carton, 12 pairs per carton.
• Carton Dimensions: 58 x 42 x 38 cm | Volume: 0.0960 CBM | Gross Weight: 8.50 kg.
• Container Loadability: Approx. 3,600 pairs per 20ft FCL / Approx. 8,500 pairs per 40ft HQ FCL.
• Primary Seaport of Loading: Tanjung Perak Seaport (ID SUB), Surabaya / Tanjung Priok (ID TKG), Jakarta, Indonesia.', 'Anak Sekolah Musim Hujan, Aktivitas Luar Ruangan Taman, Bermain Genangan Air Bersih',
