• Material Upper: Solid Rubberized Slide dengan formulasi anti-retak (UV & weather resistant) yang fleksibel mengikuti kontur pergerakan kaki secara ergonomis.
• Material Outsole: Molded PVC Cleated Sole ergonomis anti-slip (Flat Anti-Slip Suction Sipes) untuk daya cengkeram stabil di lantai basah, keramik, dan permukaan harian.
• Insole & Kenyamanan: Bantalan insole anatomis penyerap getaran (shock absorption) yang meminimalkan kelelahan kaki saat pemakaian jangka panjang sepanjang hari.
• Dimensi Fisik: Tinggi Profil/Shaft 6.5 cm | Bobot Rata-Rata: 360 gram per pasang | Pilihan Ukuran: EU 38 - 43.

[FITUR KESELAMATAN & STANDAR KUALITAS]
• Proteksi Utama: Sandal Selop Pria Tradisional, Tahan Diinjak Bertahun-Tahun.
• Proteksi Kaki & Jari: None.
• Ketahanan Air & Perawatan Mudah: 100% tahan air, mudah dicuci/disterilkan, cepat kering, serta tahan terhadap paparan cairan harian dan deterjen ringan.
• Sertifikasi Resmi: Memenuhi Standar Nasional Indonesia (SNI 0111:2009), ISO 9001:2015, dan standar mutu pabrik PT Waru Gunung.

[REKOMENDASI APLIKASI]
Sangat ideal digunakan pada sektor: Area Basah Kolam Renang, Kasir Supermarket, Santai Harian, Pekerja Pasar Tradisional.

[PANDUAN PEMILIHAN UKURAN & PERAWATAN]
• Panduan Ukuran: EU 38 - 43. Disarankan memilih ukuran standar alas kaki harian Anda. Jika memakai kaus kaki tebal, pertimbangkan memilih 1 nomor lebih besar.
• Petunjuk Perawatan: Bersihkan permukaan dengan air mengalir setelah pemakaian. Keringkan di area berventilasi baik dan teduh. Hindari penjemuran langsung di bawah terik matahari agar polimer tetap elastis dan tahan bertahun-tahun.', '[EXECUTIVE PRODUCT OVERVIEW]
Ap Boots 1001 HITAM is a lightweight waterproof slip-on garden, leisure & wet-area clogs/sandals engineered by PT Waru Gunung and distributed internationally by PT Indo Sukses Semesta (HOTS Trading). Built utilizing advanced direct high-pressure single-shot injection molding technology, this product provides 100% seamless waterproofing, zero-delamination guarantee, and reliable durability for commercial, institutional, and consumer markets worldwide.

[TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS MATRIX]
• Upper Material: Solid Rubberized Slide formulated with virgin polymer elastomeric blends for high tensile strength, continuous flex endurance, and crack resistance.
• Outsole Construction: Molded PVC Cleated Sole engineered with ergonomic anti-slip tread geometry, achieving reliable slip resistance (Flat Anti-Slip Suction Sipes) across wet tiles, smooth floors, and daily commercial surfaces.
• Comfort Architecture: Anatomical shock-absorbing footbed with quick-drying interior support to mitigate moisture build-up and foot fatigue during prolonged wear.
• Physical Parameters: Profile/Shaft Height: 6.5 cm | Unit Weight: 360 g/pair | Sizing Range: EU 38 - 43.

[SAFETY SPECIFICATIONS & REGULATORY COMPLIANCE]
• Impact & Compression Protection: None.
• Underfoot Penetration Shield: Ergonomic Textured Footbed.
• Quality Assurance Standards: Complies with SNI 0111:2009, ISO 9001:2015, and GPSR EU 2023/988 quality criteria.
• Material & Environmental Defense: High resistance against water, mild detergents, mineral oils, and everyday surface wear.

[RECOMMENDED APPLICATIONS]
Specifically tailored for: Poolside Wet Areas, Retail Cashiers, Casual Domestic Wear, Wet Market Utility.

[EXPORT PACKAGING & LOGISTICS CAPABILITIES]
• Master Carton Packaging: Export Grade 5-Ply Corrugated Master Carton, 24 pairs per carton.
• Carton Dimensions: 58 x 42 x 38 cm | Volume: 0.1100 CBM | Gross Weight: 10.50 kg.
• Container Loadability: Approx. 7,200 pairs per 20ft FCL / Approx. 17,000 pairs per 40ft HQ FCL.
• Primary Seaport of Loading: Tanjung Perak Seaport (ID SUB), Surabaya / Tanjung Priok (ID TKG), Jakarta, Indonesia.', 'Area Basah Kolam Renang, Kasir Supermarket, Santai Harian, Pekerja Pasar Tradisional',
