• Material Upper: Triple Black All-Weather PVC dengan formulasi anti-retak (UV & weather resistant) yang fleksibel mengikuti kontur pergerakan kaki secara ergonomis.
• Material Outsole: Molded PVC Cleated Sole ergonomis anti-slip (Herringbone Siped Rubber Sole) untuk daya cengkeram stabil di lantai basah, keramik, dan permukaan harian.
• Insole & Kenyamanan: Bantalan insole anatomis penyerap getaran (shock absorption) yang meminimalkan kelelahan kaki saat pemakaian jangka panjang sepanjang hari.
• Dimensi Fisik: Tinggi Profil/Shaft 9.5 cm | Bobot Rata-Rata: 650 gram per pasang | Pilihan Ukuran: EU 38 - 43.

[FITUR KESELAMATAN & STANDAR KUALITAS]
• Proteksi Utama: Pilihan Tepat untuk Pekerja Gudang Maupun Pelajar saat Musim Hujan Tiba.
• Proteksi Kaki & Jari: Vulcanized Style Cap.
• Ketahanan Air & Perawatan Mudah: 100% tahan air, mudah dicuci/disterilkan, cepat kering, serta tahan terhadap paparan cairan harian dan deterjen ringan.
• Sertifikasi Resmi: Memenuhi Standar Nasional Indonesia (SNI 0111:2009), ISO 9001:2015, dan standar mutu pabrik PT Waru Gunung.

[REKOMENDASI APLIKASI]
Sangat ideal digunakan pada sektor: Pekerja Lapangan Santai, Gaya Kasual Tahan Air, Komuter Hujan Modis.

[PANDUAN PEMILIHAN UKURAN & PERAWATAN]
• Panduan Ukuran: EU 38 - 43. Disarankan memilih ukuran standar alas kaki harian Anda. Jika memakai kaus kaki tebal, pertimbangkan memilih 1 nomor lebih besar.
• Petunjuk Perawatan: Bersihkan permukaan dengan air mengalir setelah pemakaian. Keringkan di area berventilasi baik dan teduh. Hindari penjemuran langsung di bawah terik matahari agar polimer tetap elastis dan tahan bertahun-tahun.', '[EXECUTIVE PRODUCT OVERVIEW]
AP STAR Hitam Hitam is a waterproof casual everyday PVC sneakers engineered by PT Waru Gunung and distributed internationally by PT Indo Sukses Semesta (HOTS Trading). Built utilizing advanced direct high-pressure single-shot injection molding technology, this product provides 100% seamless waterproofing, zero-delamination guarantee, and reliable durability for commercial, institutional, and consumer markets worldwide.

[TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS MATRIX]
• Upper Material: Triple Black All-Weather PVC formulated with virgin polymer elastomeric blends for high tensile strength, continuous flex endurance, and crack resistance.
• Outsole Construction: Molded PVC Cleated Sole engineered with ergonomic anti-slip tread geometry, achieving reliable slip resistance (Herringbone Siped Rubber Sole) across wet tiles, smooth floors, and daily commercial surfaces.
• Comfort Architecture: Anatomical shock-absorbing footbed with quick-drying interior support to mitigate moisture build-up and foot fatigue during prolonged wear.
• Physical Parameters: Profile/Shaft Height: 9.5 cm | Unit Weight: 650 g/pair | Sizing Range: EU 38 - 43.

[SAFETY SPECIFICATIONS & REGULATORY COMPLIANCE]
• Impact & Compression Protection: Vulcanized Style Cap.
• Underfoot Penetration Shield: Cushioned Insole.
• Quality Assurance Standards: Complies with SNI 0111:2009, ISO 9001:2015, and GPSR EU 2023/988 quality criteria.
• Material & Environmental Defense: High resistance against water, mild detergents, mineral oils, and everyday surface wear.

[RECOMMENDED APPLICATIONS]
Specifically tailored for: Casual Field Workers, Waterproof Fashion Commuting.

[EXPORT PACKAGING & LOGISTICS CAPABILITIES]
• Master Carton Packaging: Export Grade 5-Ply Corrugated Master Carton, 12 pairs per carton.
• Carton Dimensions: 58 x 42 x 38 cm | Volume: 0.0960 CBM | Gross Weight: 11.50 kg.
• Container Loadability: Approx. 3,600 pairs per 20ft FCL / Approx. 8,500 pairs per 40ft HQ FCL.
• Primary Seaport of Loading: Tanjung Perak Seaport (ID SUB), Surabaya / Tanjung Priok (ID TKG), Jakarta, Indonesia.', 'Pekerja Lapangan Santai, Gaya Kasual Tahan Air, Komuter Hujan Modis',
